# design-reference HTML / CSS

Read root `AGENTS.md` and `design-reference/README.md` first. This folder is frozen visual
reference, not Vite product source; implement shipping UI under `src/`.

- Tokens: `design-reference/assets/css/global.css` (`:root`). Page CSS for layout/feature chrome only.
- Prefer modern CSS: `clamp()`, `min()`, `color-mix()`, `aspect-ratio`, `dvh`, safe-area insets.
- Mobile-first breakpoints ~640 / 768 / 1024 when matching existing static pages.
- Touch targets ≥ 44px; no fixed desktop-only widths without fluid fallback.
- Do not invent a parallel token system here. Shipping product tokens belong in `src/styles/global.css`.
